  "name": "食谱：白淞鲜汤",
  "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「白淞鲜汤」的制作方法。</span></p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/28/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_1764773542854887461.png",
